Package: hfdParity
Type: Package
Title: Functions for producing age/parity weightings from census data
Version: 2.0-1077
Date: 2015-04-26
Author: Edward Nash <nash@demogr.mpg.de>
Maintainer: Edward Nash <edward.nash@gmx.de>
Imports: stats
Depends: hfdCohortFertilityTable, hfdBasicIndicators,
        hfdLexisManipulation, abind
Enhances: hfdPeriodFertilityTable
Description: This package provides functions for producing age/parity weightings on 1st January
  from census or register data, which may be taken at any time in the year, using methods as described
  in the Human Fertility Database Methods Protocol. Such weightings are one of the inputs to the
  production of period fertility tables.
Copyright: Human Fertility Database project - Max Planck Institute for
        Demographic Research (Germany) and Vienna Institute of
        Demography (Austria)
